  "instructions": [
    "preheat oven to 400 degrees fahrenheit.",
    "season cod fillets with flaked sea salt, black pepper, and binchotan charcoal powder.",
    "in a large skillet, melt the unsalted butter over medium heat.",
    "add the chopped fresh dill and cook for 1-2 minutes, or until fragrant.",
    "add the grated norwegian cheese and cook until melted and smooth.",
    "transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake for 8-10 minutes, or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "meanwhile, mix the unsweetened almond milk with the lemon juice and ginger paste in a small bowl.",
    "remove the skillet from the oven and top the cod fillets with the sauce.",
    "sprinkle the panko breadcrumbs over the top and return to the oven for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until golden brown.",
    "remove from the oven and let rest for 2-3 minutes before serving.",
    "serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
